     "html": "<span style=\"color:rgb(255,231,127)\"><span style=\"font-style:italic\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-futura)\">\"La Mer” is a deep journey into dr.gam's imagination. The fusion of a dream, a compelling story and an exceptional visual creation creates a multi-sensory experience that stands out in the musical landscape. The artist, inspired by the vision, captured his mother's words in his French-language dream, transforming the experience into a musical masterpiece</span></span></span></span>",
